{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>梵蒂岡教廷公開教宗良十四世，接受肺癌手術後的首批照片。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"VAT.POPE-0100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PBe6xn1od01792188128.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>教廷周五公開圖片，指確診肺腺癌的良十四世在傑梅利醫院切除部分肺葉後，他身穿祭衣親自主持彌撒。當時多名不值班的醫生、護理人員，以及梵蒂岡警衛隊人員在場。教宗在彌撒講道中，向所有醫護人員致意。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAT.POPE 0100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kVYziGF8xL1792189569.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>教廷指良十四世接受血液檢查及拍攝胸部X光片，顯示其健康狀況有好轉，可完全如常活動。他又收到來自醫院兒童腫瘤科的信件和圖畫。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T23:39:13.973501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T01:17:52.644160+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:39.850731+00:00","content_hash":"7b6627397bccda32de088b3602ef1fb8bbd3c76d85152295e4c53954c52a1afc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}